            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu Jesu waapha mfwano, waamba, “Dze chipofu anaweza kumlongoza njira chipofu myawe? Hata! Kaweza, mana osi airi andagbwa dibwani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.39",
