            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu waenderera kugomba achiamba, “Phahi, mbona munaniiha ‘Bwana, Bwana,’ ela tamuhenda go nigombago? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami nindakuambirani mutu asikiraye maneno gangu na kugalunga arivyo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiye ni dza mutu yedzenga nyumba, achitsimba msingi wa ndani na achidzenga dzulu ya mwamba. Mafuriko gariphokpwedza, gapiga nyumba ela taiyagbwa, mana kala ikadzengbwa vinono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela yuya asikiraye maneno gangu na akagapuza, ni dza mutu yedzenga nyumba dzulu ya mtsanga bila ya kutsimba msingi. Mafuriko gariphokpwedza gapiga hira nyumba, na kano nyumba ichigbwa na kubomokakpwe kpwakala kukulu sana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
